# Lore

Lore is Risto's private knowledge: who he is, how he works, and what he knows about each project.
It is the entry point for agents and for Risto. "Update lore" means write it here.

Each folder is its own private git repo. Which ones are cloned depends on the machine:

{{ range (splitList "," (index . "loreRepos" | default "")) -}}
{{- $repo := trim . -}}
{{- if $repo -}}
- `{{ $repo | base | trimPrefix "lore-" }}/`
{{ end -}}
{{- end }}
Each repo's `readme.md` states its scope, what never goes in it, and its layout. Read it
before writing there.

## Where writes go

- Facts about Risto that hold everywhere (preferences, conventions): `risto/`.
- Work for an employer or a project: that repo.
- Unsure: the narrower repo. Moving content toward a broader repo can leak for good, while the
  reverse is safe to fix later.

## Status (2026-11-13)

This is a baseline copy. Each repo's `.llms/` is still the live source until the cutover, so
read from `.llms/` and don't edit the copies here.

chezmoi writes this file from `~/.local/share/chezmoi/lore/readme.md.tmpl`.
